Tileflow Community Maps

Contains code and original map artwork extracted from Tileflow SDK's @tileflow/maps package:
https://github.com/tileflow/tileflow-sdk/tree/0002bc06da87606fa99b98d09191afa87ef20567/packages/maps

The extracted code and original artwork retain their Apache License 2.0 terms.
The original Cyberpunk extraction was briefly named Neon Grid; its canonical community name is
Cyberpunk. Matrix is now Terminal. This repository owns their map, theme, and icon identifiers.
Super Tile World was extracted from revision d2e09827a37b76a0a5d1750ecec47d02a968d8b2,
including its original artwork and font notices. Package resources are relocated and shared
authoring helpers are adapted to public Core APIs. Font bytes are preserved from the source
revision, including the documented Tile World Arcade naming derivative.
